name: Strength — rank up
author: corpus
description: >-
  Strength increases the rank of up to 2 selected cards by 1 (A→2→...→K→A). First-shop
  rank engine: pair with rank-based payoffs (Odd Todd, Even Steven, Fibonacci, Baron,
  Shoot the Moon).
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - tarotCard: Strength
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: Baron
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: ShootTheMoon
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Fibonacci
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
